      "jp": "セキエンさんを連れて妖怪島にやってきた。\n妖怪好きの彼女は島に着くなり目を輝かせて――。",
      "jp_sha256": "c6b3f0f2c42e5fe6cc97c48591c627343bc4e25c5dc8a910d0b82a860af3cd49",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "세키엔 씨를 데리고 요괴섬에 왔다.\n요괴를 좋아하는 그녀는 섬에 도착하자마자 눈을 반짝이며――.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "f28fdac653b35a95cb2496c1e13b89076741f4b63c9aba7133f6aa1497b0597a:000000_-3918280215207039800:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "セキエンさんを連れて妖怪島にやってきた。\n妖怪好きの彼女は島に着くなり目を輝かせて――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "bca5c098ab1da7d52722eb8e5b46b104c2201f5f6991ded5cbc920281467cfc8",
